\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Core DUET architecture. A shared causal VLM feeds two action geometries: the relative branch learns a state-aware tangent command, while the absolute branch is state-isolated and predicts a global waypoint through RVQ atlas anchoring and CFG flow matching. At deployment, tangent-projection disagreement and state distance produce a soft fusion gate.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
